`@jvm` settings beat unqualified ones; test settings are not the main fragment's.
--- module.yaml
product: jvm/app
settings:
  jvm:
    release: 21
settings@jvm:
  jvm:
    release: 22
test-settings:
  jvm:
    release: 23
--- expected
module.yaml:7:5: ERROR: Setting `release` can only be used without any @platform qualifier.
ERROR: Conflicting values for property `release` in context [test, jvm, module.yaml]:\n  - `22`, defined at:\n    ╰─ module.yaml:7:14\n  - `23`, defined at:\n    ╰─ module.yaml:10:14
